        {
          "text": "**Third-Wave Therapies:** Explore how Stoicism intersects with ACT (Acceptance and Commitment Therapy), particularly the concept of \"Cognitive Defusion.\"",
          "indent_level": 1,
          "line_number": 136,
          "source": "topic-set-cognitive-architecture-of-stoicism-20251128210819.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**The Paradox of Happiness:** Investigate the \"Backwards Law\" (Alan Watts/Viktor Frankl) and how the Stoic dismissal of pleasure-seeking aligns with modern findings on the emptiness of hedonic pursuit.",
