          "line_number": 138,
          "source": "topic-set-cognitive-architecture-of-stoicism-20251128210819.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Embodied Cognition:** How Stoic physical postures and moderation in diet relate to the theory that our bodies influence our cognitive states.",
